
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Basemap tiles (client build-time variable — belongs in client/.env)
#
# Without a key the map falls back to plain OpenStreetMap tiles, which need no
# account but have no dark style (App.css darkens them with a CSS filter).
# With a Stadia Maps key both light and dark get their proper style.
# Sign up at https://client.stadiamaps.com/ and paste the key here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REACT_APP_MAP_TILES_KEY=
